{"id":"steam-1356250","steam":1356250,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Airport Renovator","summary":"Take matters into your own hands and renovate a run-down airport! You have the right tools for the job, so clean up and restore this place. Open up the loot crates and collect pieces of equipment that you can arrange according to your plan. Make this airport an international giant!","about":"CHAT WITH US ON DISCORD\r\n\r\n\r\nThis airport has been in a terrible state for a long time, and now it’s up to you to make it great again! Fight the forces of nature that have taken over this place. Use modern tools,  destroy, trim, clean, and renovate.\r\n\r\nIt’s all in your hands\r\n\r\nUse multiple tools to destroy, trim, clean up and wash elements of the airport area. Only a few things in life are as satisfying as power cleaning a dirty airplane! \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFlying cargo\r\n\r\nCollect supplies that will be delivered to you via parachute drops! Use the items wisely and plan out where you want them to be placed. You never know what you’re going to get in the next loot crate!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlan and decide\r\n\r\nStart with a small airport and end up with a massive, international one! Manage, equip, expand, and remember that this place will be visited by thousands of people every day.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBattle the forces of nature\r\n\r\nThis place has not seen a human for years and has become a jungle. Can you overcome the overgrown vegetation in constantly changing weather conditions?","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/library_600x900.jpg?t=1713180075","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/header.jpg?t=1713180075","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/library_hero.jpg?t=1713180075","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356250/header.jpg?t=1713180075","background":"https://shared.akam